# 基本図形編集のプロセスの道具パネル (design 11.3, 17.13), for tools/ui_run.py: as
# ui_fig_tools.steps has it with the desktop's figure editor. The figure 画用紙 is opened
# with the process; its panel stands at the top of the screen (100,0), its buttons 32
# square, the first row's middles at y 48 and the second's at 82, 34 apart from x 128. The
# rectangle template is taken (in hand: emphasised), taken again (drawing from the middle:
# the red mark), and a rectangle drawn. The palettes come up under their buttons, as
# windows of the process subordinate to the panel, where the desktop's stand (framed, with
# no title): 線色 with the red of its swatches, 塗りつぶし with one of the fixed
# patterns, 角丸 with 10 typed and Enter, each put away with Escape; 線種, 倍率, 格子点 and
# 書式 come up and go. 塗りつぶし's 〈パターン編集...〉 says it is not there yet.
logmark
pfig 019a0f91-066f-706f-93da-ffe8150d6207
expectsincein 60 figure: opened 画用紙
wait 800
shot ptool_panel
logmark
click 298 82
expectsince figure: tool 7
wait 300
shot ptool_rect
logmark
click 298 82
expectsince figure: tool 7 centre
wait 300
shot ptool_centre
logmark
drag 450 450 600 560
expectsince figure: drawn
logmark
click 162 48
expectsince figure: palette 1 open
wait 400
shot ptool_stroke
click 359 125
wait 300
key 29
expectsince figure: palette 1 closed
logmark
click 128 48
expectsince figure: palette 0 open
wait 400
shot ptool_fill
click 202 170
wait 300
key 29
expectsince figure: palette 0 closed
logmark
click 230 48
expectsince figure: palette 3 open
key 2a
key 1e
key 27
key 28
expectsince figure: palette 3 closed
wait 300
shot ptool_done
logmark
click 196 48
expectsince figure: palette 2 open
wait 400
shot ptool_lstyle
key 29
expectsince figure: palette 2 closed
logmark
click 332 48
expectsince figure: palette 6 open
wait 400
shot ptool_zoom
key 29
expectsince figure: palette 6 closed
logmark
click 366 48
expectsince figure: palette 7 open
wait 400
shot ptool_grid
key 29
expectsince figure: palette 7 closed
logmark
click 502 82
expectsince figure: palette 18 open
wait 400
shot ptool_font
key 29
expectsince figure: palette 18 closed
# 〈パターン編集...〉 from 塗りつぶし
logmark
click 128 48
expectsince figure: palette 0 open
wait 400
click 192 299
expectsince figure: palette 0 closed (3)
wait 500
shot ptool_pattern
key 28
wait 300
